<title>FRANCE: Cofinoga posts H1 profit rise.</title>
<headline>Cofinoga posts H1 profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					    131.5  vs	   111.8</p>
<p>    Net banking income			   989  vs	     839</p>
<p>    New lending				  9,390  vs	   7,544</p>
<p>    Total lending			     17,642  vs	  15,173</p>
<p>NOTE - Cofinoga consumer credit company, part of Group Galeries Lafayette, issued the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
